card.statement:
The action of $\Gamma$ on $V(T(\bar{v}))$ is given by the formulas:

\begin{align}
c_{rs}(T(\bar{v}+w))=&\gamma_{rs}(\bar{v}+w)T(\bar{v}+w), \\
c_{rs}(\mathcal{D}T(\bar{v}+w))=&\gamma_{rs}(\bar{v}+w)\mathcal{D}T(\bar{v}+w)+\mathcal{D}^{\bar{v}}(\gamma_{rs}(v+w))T(\bar{v}+w).
\end{align}
